  "description": "Reconnaissance imaging satellites for Earth observation: high-resolution optical telescopes (Keyhole heritage, sub-meter GSD) and synthetic aperture radar (SAR) for all-weather, day-night imaging. Publicly-documented characteristics include sun-synchronous orbits, optical mirror assemblies, and digital focal planes. Commercial systems now achieve 25-30 cm GSD.",
